WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:04.410
Mendelevium, which is named after one of the
most important people as

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:08.250
far as the periodic table is concerned, which
is Dimitri Mendeleev.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:14.070
Mendelevium is named after Mendeleev, in Russia
the periodic table is

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:20.099
called the Mendeleev table, and you can see
here on my tie I’ve got a

00:00:20.099 --> 00:00:21.099
picture of Mendeleev.

00:00:21.099 --> 00:00:26.820
It’s another element which has absolutely
zero use in the real world.

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:32.700
He is one of the iconic, iconic, pictures
of chemists that most chemists

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.690
will recognise Mendeleev.

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:38.660
Ah, Mendeleev was all to do with how it was
discovered to put the

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:43.430
periodic table together, for a long time,
people knew that there were

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:46.500
different elements and that they knew that
they had different properties.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.930
What they couldn’t do, was rationalise those
properties and understand

00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:55.570
why certain elements behaved in a similar
manner even though in

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.100
principle they should have been very different.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:05.100
But Mendeleev has another cause of fame; he
is famous in Russia

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:10.900
because he was the person who worked out the
standard for the

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:15.490
strength of vodka. So here I have a bottle
of Russian Mendeleev, you’ll

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:21.420
see it says Mendeleev here and vodka, with
a periodic table on it, and

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:26.549
here’s the formula, ethanol plus water,
and Mendeleev was the person

00:01:26.549 --> 00:01:32.990
that worked out the standard of 40% of ethanol
in water as being vodka.

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:36.549
And in fact it’s remarkable the number of
experiments you read where

00:01:36.549 --> 00:01:41.819
people have used 40% ethanol in water as the
solvent for their reaction

00:01:41.819 --> 00:01:45.579
doubtless because they had a handy bottle
of vodka or some similar

00:01:45.579 --> 00:01:45.950
drink.

